                                    <watches>2</watches>
                                                                                                                <comments>
                            <comment id="15871645" author="vozerov" created="Fri, 17 Feb 2017 10:46:10 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;This is a regression from &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-4239&quot; title=&quot;Public thread pool starvation is cause of deadlock when user&amp;#39;s jobs calls cache.size()&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-4239&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-4239&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; (commit &lt;tt&gt;861fab9&lt;/tt&gt;). It fixed a starvation when &lt;tt&gt;IgniteCache.clear()&lt;/tt&gt; was called from compute task. With this fix we moved size calculation to management pool. &lt;br/&gt;
The problem is that &lt;tt&gt;VisorCacheClearTask&lt;/tt&gt; is also executed in management pool, so when all threads from the pool are exhausted we receive a hang. &lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="15874413" author="anovikov" created="Mon, 20 Feb 2017 11:39:26 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Fixed hangs in VisorCacheClearTask.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                    </comments>
